{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05799","headline":"送王判官 · 徐安贞","name":"送王判官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"明月开三峡，花源出五谿。\n城池青壁里，烟火绿林西。\n不畏王程促，惟愁仙路迷。\n巴东下归櫂，莫待夜猨啼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐安贞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05799.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05799","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}